---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Resume | Chase Fiore" description="Show Set Designer and BIM + Scenic Integration Specialist with over 10 years of experience in immersive entertainment and themed attraction development.">
  <main>
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Chase Fiore</h1>
      <p class="title">Show Set Designer &amp; BIM + Scenic Integration Specialist</p>
      <p class="summary">
        Multidisciplinary designer with over 10 years of experience in immersive entertainment and themed
        attraction development. Highly skilled in scenic documentation, 3D modeling, and show set integration
        with cross-functional teams. Delivered high-profile projects for Disney Live Entertainment, Universal
        Creative, and Falcon's Treehouse using Revit, AutoCAD, Rhino, and Adobe tools. Known for leadership
        in BIM coordination, drawing package development, and creative problem-solving across disciplines.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="resume-body">

      <!-- ── Experience ── -->
      <section>
        <h2>Experience</h2>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">Oct 2025 – Present</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>BIM Maestro</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Forward Thinking Design — Ocoee, FL</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Designs and project manages high-end audio, video, and control systems.</li>
              <li>Expert in Meyer Sound systems, Christie Digital cinemas, QSYS control systems, and Dolby Atmos.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">Jan 2023 – Oct 2025</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>CAD Designer</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Disney Live Entertainment — Orlando, FL</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Led BIM coordination for large-scale projects, integrating vendor files across various formats.</li>
              <li>Created full scenic drawing packages for major EPCOT and Magic Kingdom events, integrating scenic, lighting, and audio elements.</li>
              <li>Collaborated directly with Production Designers and Art Directors to articulate design intent from concept through execution.</li>
              <li>Delivered over 20 drawing packages for high-visibility entertainment experiences seen by millions of guests.</li>
              <li>Partnered with lighting, audio, video, and show control teams to achieve cohesive designs.</li>
              <li>Mentored and trained team members; attended Autodesk University 2024.</li>
            </ul>
            <ul class="project-list">
              <li>Luminous: A Symphony of Us</li>
              <li>Disney Villains: Unfairly Ever After</li>
              <li>Celebración Encanto</li>
              <li>EPCOT Forever</li>
              <li>4th of July 2023 &amp; 2024</li>
              <li>Disney Treasure Christening</li>
              <li>Disney on Broadway Redesign</li>
              <li>Garden Rocks Redesign</li>
              <li>Eat to the Beat Redesign</li>
              <li>Candlelight Processional Star Update</li>
              <li>New Year's Eve 2023 &amp; 2024</li>
              <li>EPCOT Festival of the Holidays 2023 &amp; 2024</li>
              <li>Figment Character Greeting</li>
              <li>Mickey and Minnie D100 Character Greeting</li>
              <li>Asha Character Greeting</li>
              <li>Disney Dreamers Academy 2024 &amp; 2025</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">Jan 2024 – Nov 2024</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>Freelance Designer</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Lightasmic — Orlando, FL</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Developed comprehensive drawing packages for three holiday-themed light spectaculars in minor league stadiums, including electrical layouts, rigging plans, and scenic integration.</li>
              <li>Collaborated with lighting designers and show control teams to ensure accurate representation of visual concepts.</li>
              <li>Coordinated remotely with fabrication vendors and on-site crew to meet aggressive holiday deadlines.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">Mar 2022 – Jan 2023</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>Interior Designer</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Falcon's Treehouse — Orlando, FL</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Worked on multi-million dollar immersive entertainment destinations, balancing creative vision with technical feasibility.</li>
              <li>Acted as primary BIM coordinator, addressing all project needs and establishing workflows for efficient integration.</li>
              <li>Created detailed show set design documentation for themed entertainment projects.</li>
              <li>Delivered photorealistic renderings using Photoshop and Revit to convey design intent.</li>
            </ul>
            <ul class="project-list">
              <li>Katmandu Punta Cana</li>
              <li>Falcon's Resort</li>
              <li>Exit 15 Indoor Snow Park</li>
              <li>K11 Digital Aquarium</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">Jun 2021 – Mar 2022</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>PhotoPass Photographer &amp; Gondola Host</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Walt Disney World — Orlando, FL</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Honored with EPCOT Photo of the Year and Photo of the Month awards for excellence in guest engagement and visual storytelling.</li>
              <li>Coordinated with entertainment and operations teams to manage high-volume photo locations during peak seasons.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">Jan 2021 – May 2021</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>Audiovisual &amp; Technology Drafter</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Theatre Projects — Denver, CO</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Designed advanced parametric BIM families and created schematic design documentation for large-scale venues.</li>
              <li>Produced 3D and VR renderings using Twinmotion and Unreal Engine.</li>
            </ul>
            <ul class="project-list">
              <li>Robert A. Iger Building</li>
              <li>Dr. Phillips Center</li>
              <li>Brigham Young University</li>
              <li>Rochester Institute of Technology</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">Dec 2019 – May 2021</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>Show Set Designer</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">FrankNDesign — Orlando, FL</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Modeled and integrated 3D show set designs using Revit and Rhino, adhering to Universal Creative standards.</li>
              <li>Developed Revit family modeling standards and implemented Dynamo scripts.</li>
              <li>Delivered high-quality Revit-based documentation used in pitch and construction deliverables.</li>
            </ul>
            <ul class="project-list">
              <li>Ministry of Magic</li>
              <li>Hooligan's Grog &amp; Gruel</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">Jun 2019 – Jan 2020</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>Show Set Design Intern</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Universal Creative — Orlando, FL</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Created conceptual and technical drafting packages using Revit and AutoCAD for major Universal parks expansion projects.</li>
              <li>Translated blue-sky concepts into buildable assets under Universal Creative's rigorous design standards.</li>
              <li>Designed and implemented an asset tracking system for version control across departments.</li>
            </ul>
            <ul class="project-list">
              <li>Ministry of Magic</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">Jan 2019 – Jun 2019</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>SCADpro — Volvo Car Technology USA LLC</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Savannah College of Art and Design — Savannah, GA</span>
            <p>
              SCAD is collaborating with Volvo Car Technology USA LLC to assist in the research and
              development of concepts for the future of the user cabin experience. Any public statements
              or submissions for publications, or presentations to audiences at conferences, other than
              use of the Statement, must be approved in writing by the Company, provided that Company
              agrees to approve or deny any such proposed statements or submissions promptly, but not
              later than fifteen (15) days following submission of the proposal to Company.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">Jun 2005 – May 2021</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>Earlier Experience</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Various</span>
            <p>
              Roles spanning automotive management (Fiore Automotive Group, 2013–2018),
              audio engineering (Pittsburgh Recording Services; Freelance Audio Inc.),
              IATSE over-hire for national concert and televised sports productions,
              and technical crew at Carnegie Mellon University and KCACTF.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- ── Education ── -->
      <section>
        <h2>Education</h2>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">2018 – 2024</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>MFA — Themed Entertainment Design (all but thesis)</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Savannah College of Art and Design (SCAD)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">CMU</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>BS — Technical Writing &amp; Communication</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Carnegie Mellon University</span>
            <p>Emphasis in Software Documentation · Minor in Drama</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">2015</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>Dealer Candidate Academy</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">NADA</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- ── Awards ── -->
      <section>
        <h2>Awards</h2>
        <div class="entry">
          <div class="entry-meta">
            <span class="entry-date">2025</span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>Best New Attraction Installation of 2025</h3>
            <span class="entry-company">Harry Potter and the Battle at the Ministry</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ── Certifications ── -->
      <section>
        <h2>Certifications</h2>
        <ul class="certs-grid">
          <li>Meyer Sound — System Design &amp; Optimization</li>
          <li>Christie Digital — Digital Cinema Design</li>
          <li>Dolby Atmos — System Design</li>
          <li>Dante Certification Level 1 &amp; 2 — Audinate</li>
          <li>PLD &amp; CXD Processing Amplifier — QSC</li>
          <li>Recognized AV Technologist — AVIXA</li>
          <li>Agile Project Management — Google</li>
          <li>Revit 2019: Essential Training — LinkedIn Learning</li>
          <li>Visual &amp; Literary Culture in Nineteenth Century Japan — University of Tokyo</li>
          <li>The Architectural Imagination — Harvard University</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- ── Software ── -->
      <section>
        <h2>Software &amp; Skills</h2>

        <div class="skills-block">
          <h4>3D, CAD &amp; BIM</h4>
          <ul class="skills-grid">
            <li>Revit</li>
            <li>AutoCAD</li>
            <li>Rhino</li>
            <li>SketchUp</li>
            <li>Navisworks</li>
            <li>ACC / BIM 360</li>
            <li>Clash Detection</li>
            <li>Dynamo</li>
            <li>Meyer Mapp</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="skills-block">
          <h4>Rendering &amp; Visualization</h4>
          <ul class="skills-grid">
            <li>Twinmotion</li>
            <li>Unreal Engine</li>
            <li>Photoshop</li>
            <li>Illustrator</li>
            <li>InDesign</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="skills-block">
          <h4>Technical &amp; Project</h4>
          <ul class="skills-grid">
            <li>Python</li>
            <li>GIS Manipulation</li>
            <li>Jira</li>
            <li>Bluebeam</li>
            <li>Windows</li>
            <li>Linux (Fedora, Ubuntu)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  main {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0 2rem 6rem;
  }

  /* ── Header ── */
  .page-header {
    padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .page-header .title {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .page-header .summary {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(232, 232, 232, 0.7);
    max-width: 72ch;
  }

  /* ── Sections ── */
  .resume-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  section h2 {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* ── Entries ── */
  .entry {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .entry:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .entry-meta {
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .entry-date {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .entry-content h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .entry-company {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .entry-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .entry-content ul li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(232, 232, 232, 0.75);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .entry-content p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(232, 232, 232, 0.65);
  }

  .project-list {
    list-style: none !important;
    padding-left: 0 !important;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem !important;
  }

  .project-list li {
    font-size: 0.72rem !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--accent) !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(200, 168, 122, 0.35);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  /* ── Certifications ── */
  .certs-grid {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .certs-grid li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: rgba(232, 232, 232, 0.75);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .certs-grid li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  /* ── Skills ── */
  .skills-block {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .skills-block:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .skills-block h4 {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .skills-grid {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .skills-grid li {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .skills-grid li:hover {
    border-color: rgba(200, 168, 122, 0.4);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    main {
      padding: 0 1rem 4rem;
    }

    .page-header {
      padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
    }

    .entry {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .entry-date {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
  }
</style>
